# IoT Based Health Monitoring System Using Emergency Alert Mechanism

## 📌 Project Overview

The **IoT Based Health Monitoring System Using Emergency Alert Mechanism** is a smart healthcare solution designed to continuously monitor a patient’s vital health parameters in real time using IoT technology. The system collects health data through sensors and sends alerts during emergency situations to caregivers, doctors, or family members.

This project helps in remote patient monitoring, improving healthcare accessibility and reducing response time during medical emergencies.

